# Cloudflare Pages headers for the portal. Keep the /* block identical to
# internal/websec (headers.go); TestPortalHeadersMatchEngine fails on drift.
# Strict-Transport-Security is portal-only (the engine serves plain http). It
# is set on portal.basaltvault.app, so includeSubDomains covers only that host's
# subdomains, not the rest of basaltvault.app; no preload.
# The CSP is internal/websec PortalCSP: the engine's policy plus one
# connect-src, the Vault (wss://relay.basaltvault.app), which carries a short
# link's session to its engine. Nothing else: the portal pages never fetch
# their own origin or any other. script-src and the rest fall back to
# default-src 'self': the pages load only their own modules.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; connect-src wss://relay.basaltvault.app; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains

/*.js
  Content-Type: text/javascript
